## Deploying Function app to Azure
az login
az group create --name func-api-rg --location eastus
# Create a Storage Account for runtime state and scaling metadata
az storage account create --name funcapistorage123 --location eastus --resource-group func-api-rg --sku Standard_LRS
# Create the Function App
az functionapp create --resource-group func-api-rg --consumption-plan-location eastus --os-type Linux --runtime python --runtime-version 3.12 --functions-version 4 --name func-api-demo --storage-account funcapistorage123
# Deploy the code
cd funcProject
func azure functionapp publish func-api-demo
# Your API will be available at: https://func-api-demo.azurewebsites.net/api/hello